{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20260wfTtbeLCH1793018501.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中環怡和大廈外牆，有吊船懷疑失控墜落到地面，兩名吊船工人一度被困半空近兩小時，最終獲救。</p><p></p><p>事發在傍晚6時許，見到兩名工人，吊在半空兩個不同位置，消防員嘗試游繩而下營救，先慢慢靠近其中一個，約10分鐘後，另一名消防員亦出動，嘗試拯救另一名工人，見到該名工人反應不大，用約7分鐘將工人固定好，揹著他離開。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.RESCUE-1930_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20264CPolxeRPA1793020449.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>見到懷疑涉事吊船墜落到地面，表面未見太大損毀。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T15:21:13.782648+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T12:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T05:58:14.974301+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T15:18:21.021323+00:00","content_hash":"33a4d8bd1c02b7e0f1fcaf763aaf98a003cfaf7c6f2abd2728961064b7844375","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T15:21:13.782648+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}